#: ../../admin/launch_setup/launcher_server/commands.rst:94
msgid "Запуск в фоне без ожидания (аналог ``docker-compose up -d``)"
msgstr "Start in the background without waiting (analogous to ``docker-compose up -d``)"

#: ../../admin/launch_setup/launcher_server/commands.rst:95
